<mxfile host="app.diagrams.net" type="device"><diagram name="Legal Knowledge Database — two pipelines"><mxGraphModel dx="1700" dy="1340" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1700" pageHeight="1340" background="#070A0F" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="n2" value="1 · PIPELINE A — INGESTION · PUBLISHER&apos;S BYTES TO A STORED, PROVABLE LAW" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#0A0F16;strokeColor=#1C2736;strokeWidth=1;fontColor=#9FB0C3;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;spacingTop=4;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="40" width="1620" height="280" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n3" value="German federal publisher

gesetze-im-internet.de
The health service downloads
the publisher&apos;s own ZIP.

gii_norm · 32 of 52 laws" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fillColor=#241B3D;strokeColor=#A78BFA;strokeWidth=1;fontColor=#E8EEF6;fontSize=13;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;spacingTop=4;fontFamily=Helvetica;dashed=1;dashPattern=3 3;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="70" y="90" width="300" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n4" value="EU · CELLAR

A FORMEX v4 bundle fetched by
content negotiation. CELLAR is the
repository, FORMEX the markup,
CELEX the identifier.

formex_v4 · 20 of 52 laws" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fillColor=#241B3D;strokeColor=#A78BFA;strokeWidth=1;fontColor=#E8EEF6;fontSize=13;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;spacingTop=4;fontFamily=Helvetica;dashed=1;dashPattern=3 3;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="70" y="210" width="300" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n5" value="1 · Acquire

The health service fetches the
publisher&apos;s own file and resolves
CELEX for EU acts. It observes and
judges freshness; it never parses.

:8000 · health service" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fillColor=#0F2340;strokeColor=#60A5FA;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#E8EEF6;fontSize=13;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;spacingTop=4;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="410" y="90" width="280" height="220" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n6" value="2 · Capture

SHA-256 before anything interprets
the bytes, written to object storage
under a fresh prefix, then one event.
Parses nothing — no ZIP, no XML.

:4675 · entity producer" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fillColor=#0B2D33;strokeColor=#22D3EE;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#E8EEF6;fontSize=13;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;spacingTop=4;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="730" y="90" width="280" height="220" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n7" value="3 · Structure

A registry decides the canonical key
and the parser; GII-NORM or
FORMEX v4 extracts citations to
provision level and chunks the active
sections — one transaction, three
ruleset digests.

:4698 · preprocessor" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fillColor=#191C3D;strokeColor=#818CF8;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#E8EEF6;fontSize=13;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;spacingTop=4;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1050" y="90" width="280" height="220" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n8" value="4 · Project

One REPEATABLE READ snapshot,
embedded with BGE-M3 (dense 1024
+ sparse, one pass), then Qdrant and
Neo4j converged in order, each fenced
on an exact count. Refuses the law
rather than truncate a vector.

