ometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n14" value="2 · THE CORPUS — THREE DATABASES, AND THE EVIDENCE BEHIND THEM" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#0A0F16;strokeColor=#1C2736;strokeWidth=1;fontColor=#9FB0C3;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;spacingTop=4;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="350" width="1620" height="240" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n15" value="PostgreSQL · the laws

Canonical legal state as tables, plus
