sole writer: entity producer" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fillColor=#2B2208;strokeColor=#F0B429;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#E8EEF6;fontSize=13;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;spacingTop=4;fontFamily=Helvetica;shadow=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1270" y="400" width="380" height="160" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n19" value="captures" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;strokeColor=#F0B429;strokeWidth=2.2;fontColor=#9FB0C3;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;labelBackgroundColor=#070A0F;jettySize=auto;orthogonalLoop=1;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n6" target="n18"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n20" value="exclusive write" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;strokeColor=#F0B429;strokeWidth=2.2;fontColor=#9FB0C3;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;labelBackgroundColor=#070A0F;jettySize=auto;orthogonalLoop=1;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n7" target="n15"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n21" value="1st" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;strokeColor=#F0B429;strokeWidth=2.2;fontColor=#9FB0C3;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;labelBackgroundColor=#070A0F;jettySize=auto;orthogonalLoop=1;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n8" target="n16"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n22" value="2nd" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;strokeColor=#F0B429;strokeWidth=2.2;fontColor=#9FB0C3;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;labelBackgroundColor=#070A0F;jettySize=auto;orthogonalLoop=1;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n8" target="n17"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n23" value="3 · VERIFICATION — ASKED AND ANSWERED AFTER EVERY INGEST" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#0A0F16;strokeColor=#1C2736;strokeWidth=1;fontColor=#9FB0C3;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;spacingTop=4;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="620" width="1620" height="210" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n24" value="Fourteen gates, run by the ingest

Publishing law.embedded is what runs them —
nobody asks. Structural fidelity, citation
correctness, cross-store equality and source
currency, and the verdict is never one badge.

7 badge-required · 7 recorded" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fillColor=#0C2A1E;strokeColor=#34D399;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#E8EEF6;fontSize=13;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;spacingTop=4;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="70" y="670" width="500" height="140" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n25" value="A denominator that cannot share the defect

The structural inventory is read a second time on
a different XML stack, importing no parser code.
And the prover proves itself first: if a certified
law stops reproducing, no law gets a verdict.

lxml iterparse · zero application imports" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fillColor=#0C2A1E;strokeColor=#34D399;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#E8EEF6;fontSize=13;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;spacingTop=4;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="600" y="670" width="500" height="140" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n26" value="Reconciliation · a different question

Verification asks whether this generation was
extracted faithfully. Reconciliation asks whether
the stores agree right now. Read-only, repairs
nothing, and says when it cannot tell.

